{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是建国纪念日。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感冒还没有彻底痊愈的我乖乖待在家休息。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……本来是这么打算的。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，新吾你看！就快生了、快生了！”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4950", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“吸、吸、呼、吸、吸、呼……加油，只差一点了！”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4951", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知道为什么她播了海龟产卵的视频给我看。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊好厉害……好多卵……哎呀，太感动了……”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4952", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“听说海龟产卵的时候会流泪？”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“的确有这种说法呢。不过其实是因为进食的同时喝了很多海水，为了避免体内残留太多盐分才用泪水排出。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4953", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿，是这样啊。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但我觉得说是眼泪也没错啦。这个说法也比较有想像空间……”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4954", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们两人坐在床边，看着即将进入尾声的海龟的产卵。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感觉得到纱凪不停偷瞄我。这让我不得不产生许多猜测。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从异性的角度来说也是……还有前天纱凪来探病的时候。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其实我记得不太清楚了……但是纱凪完全提起我烧得迷迷糊糊那时候的事。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我也很难开口问。问她“我是不是说了什么奇怪的话？”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还是说，那时真的说了纱凪也难以启齿的话……！？", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比如说那个，就是性方面的……", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不对，如果我真的说了那她一定会跟我提起。“那是怎样？感冒了就可以性骚扰吗”这样。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那么……应该没什么大问题吧？", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，那纱凪又为什么要让我看海龟的产卵呢？", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……总有一天我也好想像那样。”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4955", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是、那个……新吾的小宝宝……”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4956", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾看了这段视频也没有什么想法吗？”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4957", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪凝视着我。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "脸颊泛红。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐，新吾……”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4958", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我耳边低语。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪大胆地将身体靠在我身上。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要是传染给你就不好了，离我远一点吧。”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾的感冒的话传染给我也没关系。”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4959", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，可是……”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾不想要小宝宝吗……？”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4960", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是受海龟产卵的影响吗？纱凪说出了很不得了的话。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不想让我……生、生小宝宝吗……？”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7138", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……！？”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾！”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7139", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那种事、那个，将来的话……嗯……”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我尽全力挤出了一个敷衍的答案。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的理性已经摇摇欲坠了。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好想就这样把纱凪压倒。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果是新吾的……我……”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7140", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她因为害羞说话断断续续。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她没说完的话。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我却在脑中却擅自想像、不停回响。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 80, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘如果是新吾的小宝宝……不管几个我都想生……’", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7141", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘让我……怀孕吧……？’", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7142", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“────！！”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我甩了甩头，把妄想赶出脑袋。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾？”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7143", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、不是……”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾……”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7144", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“────”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她水润的双眼以及甜腻诱人的声音让我一时说不出话来。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪抓着我的袖子，凑近我的脸。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱、凪……”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7145", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住叫了她的名字，她便闭上了眼睛。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "长长的睫毛微微颤动，纱凪就这样把她的一切交给了我。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感受到她压上来的重量，身体动弹不得。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──最近的我连接吻都很少主动。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了想珍惜她的念头以外，想要她的身体的男性本能……在渴望第２次的行为。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这股欲望已经快要压抑不住了。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算只有接吻，一旦碰触到她我很可能会就这样侵犯她。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比第一次的时候更粗鲁的。完全没有体贴或温柔，就像只野兽。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾？”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7146", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪睁开眼睛，不安地看着我。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很清楚她在索求什么。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是我不能回应她。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了……？”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7147", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不，没什么。”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7148", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我摸摸纱凪吻头发，吻了她的脸颊一下。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我没办法直视她的双眼。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7149", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算移开视线还是感觉得到她的目光。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──好难受。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喘不过气。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我咬紧牙关，拼命忍住在自己体内叫嚣的冲动。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……只有这样……吗？”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7150", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是我逼她说了。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "女孩子不应该说出口的话。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "歉意驱使着我朝她伸出手，然后用力抱住。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7151", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪紧张得身体僵硬。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个反应与床铺的吱呀一声让我回过神来。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉。”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我紧紧抓住最后一丝理智，缓缓地放开她。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呜、咕。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7152", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪的眼眶瞬间蓄满泪水。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我反射性地抬手想为她抹去，但最后仍是只有紧紧握住拳头。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟我……接吻嘛……”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7153", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "微弱的声音。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是脸颊……”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "sn7154", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的声音在颤抖。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我真的快要呼吸不过来了。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──该怎么说明她才能懂呢？", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是接吻，现在的我绝对会失控。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我是这么地珍惜纱凪……明明想好好对待她。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是现在我没办法实现她的愿望。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对，今后也是……没错。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我有自信压抑自己体内猛兽般的冲动之前──", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你不跟我接吻啊。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4971", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是的，我想接吻，可是……”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面对女校出身的纱凪，我有些犹豫可以说到什么程度。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我无法判断她能不能理解。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不知道新吾在想什么……”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4972", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也……不知道该怎么做才好了！”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4973", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪！？”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪冲出房间，我呆坐在原地没有阻止。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后，我还是没能回应。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不懂。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "珍惜女孩子到底是怎么回事呢？", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为什么我会产生如此自私的欲望？", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果没有与她结合，今天就不会变成这样了吧？但是……我自己也不能肯定。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还是第一次……这么恨自己是个男人这个无可动摇的事实。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 80, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你不跟我接吻啊。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4971", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是的，我想接吻，可是……”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面对女校出身的纱凪，我有些犹豫可以说到什么程度。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我无法判断她能不能理解。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 4, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不知道新吾在想什么……”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4972", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也……不知道该怎么做才好了！”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 287, "voice": "_sn4973", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪！？”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪冲出房间，我呆坐在原地没有阻止。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后，我还是没能回应。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_07.txt", "scene": "*dummy1", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不懂了。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
